    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.06-14",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A supported conclusion connects the development, environmental pathway and appropriate measure. Safe sanitation addresses a different problem from noise timing or habitat protection. Monitoring checks whether the condition improved, not merely whether a service was announced. This approach links urban structure, growth and management while keeping urbanisation, sprawl and migration as distinct concepts.",
      "claim_ids": [
